WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Find a record. Start in Origination and confirm you are in the right workspace.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Choose a view. Completed narrows the list to finished requests. It does not mean approved.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Search by borrower name. Combine a view with search to find the record you need.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.300
Inspect the detail drawer. Open the borrower row. The filtered table stays behind the drawer.

5
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:30.300
Share the record link. Copy a link for an authorized teammate. The link does not grant access.

6
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:36.100
Keep your place. Close details to return to the same search and view.

7
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:41.500
Resume browsing. Clear filters to restore the full list of records.
